Description publish must merge only the marker-wrapped agent block via `mergeDescriptionIntoPrBody` (`descriptionBodyMerge.ts`); never overwrite user-authored body outside `<!-- PR_AGENT_DESCRIPTION_BEGIN -->` / `<!-- PR_AGENT_DESCRIPTION_END -->`. Map mode is server-owned (`descriptionMapMode.ts`): `omit` strips the map; `read_first` caps at five files — enforce on `submitDescription`, do not trust the model alone. Title rewrite stays behind `FEATURE_TITLE_REWRITE`.
